                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game has a lot of serious issues, it feels like an early alpha build, it's just that buggy. No music; some missing sound effects; surrounding NPC produce no sound what so ever. Why would anyone release a game in this condition!\n\nOne of the craziest issues is the resolution settings, it tells you to restart after changing the resolution but the game has an imbedded command that resets back to the default settings (\"What The *&*((@#\") is that all about!!!\n\nThe game wouldn't even launch properly until I dug into the bin file folder.\n\nI really wanted this to be a great game, I remember the original trailer which was released several years ago but the game was cancelled. I'm going to ask for a refund but if the developers can fix all these issues plauging the game I'll be more than happy to buy it again.\n",
